    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Imane Bourbel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102352926437443833654/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJnHwDIe_AE8o9QEdW0x2Eq-lSQNjHqbf0S_orAEkxs_gXFbOFb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "The best pilates studio ever! The place is beautiful and the instructors are incredibly kind and motivating (especially Geneviève!) Every class is unique, perfectly challenging and will definitely leave you feeling both strong (+ sore as soon as you're leaving) and happy!",
        "time": 1760737864,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jade Beland",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104127385799039249224/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI_i9az19YH5VPK1vaIeqEDmStDC0DMz87ZsMkQwRgGUmJ-_A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Beautiful studio. I have been to a few of Genevieve’s classes and she is a fantastic instructor. I appreciate that their schedule has so many options, there’s a time and day for everyone. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1761678230,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Olivia Lamontagne",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117337567469214567530/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQxsWOuMbHgIHZrbZwFnr6d1-HW3pw1J6YsKXQFLd_OjdqnZc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Highly recommend!\nIt’s a beautiful studio, and I always enjoy my classes. They offer sessions for every level, and I’ve been loving the Forme classes with Frédérique—just the right amount of challenge, I always leave feeling great and energized!",
        "time": 1763342460,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Makayla Burns",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115256682498105106902/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGn0uvdbKc9xUx7ug8pcy4nzw7cbtx5AlochIqDRYhxJTK2g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Amazing studio with a beautiful ambiance! And With bilingual instructors",
        "time": 1768945934,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tara S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107148649168815544299/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDE64wwl2oA-XFaWcY0-OID7ZjBHgJrVRcBzqYy9jQoUkf7w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "in the last week",
        "text": "Honestly, one of the best Pilates studios I’ve ever been to. Unlike many studios that feel more relaxing than challenging, every class here truly feels like a real workout. I’ve taken classes with different instructors, and every single one has been consistently motivating, dynamic, and effective. I always leave feeling energized and sore in the best way.\n\nThe classes are not only challenging, but also super fun, creative, and refreshing. They’re never boring and always keep things interesting. There’s such a great vibe in the studio, and you can really feel the passion behind what they do.\n\nI highly recommend this place, and I’m so happy they opened up. Definitely worth it if you’re looking for results and a great experience. 💪✨",
        "time": 1771283616,
        "translated": false
      }
